great time all by myself.

80
00:05:52,010 --> 00:05:54,180
Alright! Let's do an encore!

81
00:05:54,180 --> 00:05:55,510
Are you okay, Koyuki?

82
00:05:55,510 --> 00:05:57,180
Uh-huh...

83
00:05:57,180 --> 00:05:59,010
