84
00:05:59,010 --> 00:06:01,610
Hey, are you gonna
keep your audience waiting?!

85
00:06:03,850 --> 00:06:06,190
Koyuki's too exhausted.
Let him rest.

86
00:06:06,190 --> 00:06:08,860
Hey, Ryusuke...

87
00:06:08,860 --> 00:06:09,880
I'm outta here.

88
00:06:14,860 --> 00:06:17,960
I thought this time
we'd have a permanent band.

89
00:06:20,100 --> 00:06:21,190
Ryusuke-kun!

90
00:06:22,870 --> 00:06:24,930
Yo, what's up, Koyuki?

91
00:06:26,710 --> 00:06:28,040
-Ahh...
-Hey!

92
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:31,750
